.TH tksearchbar n 0.29.0 tkutils "Tcl/Tk Utility Library"
.SH NAME
tkutils::tksearchbar \- search bar with debounce and optional filter
.SH SYNOPSIS
package require tkutils::tksearchbar
.br
set w [::tkutils::tksearchbar::widget .s -command cmd]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Entry with a debounced change callback, a clear button, and an optional filter
drop-down. \-command is called as "cmd text filter". See docs/tksearchbar.md.
.SH "SEE ALSO"
tkutils::tktablelist(n), tkutils::tkeditor(n)
.SH KEYWORDS
Tk, widget, search, filter
